  "lyrics": "Ch,\nIswrni onnajwng, rupati fwrbwao\nSofwinw hanai, gaswi alasi\nGaham onsainanwi, gugrup kulumnanwi\n\"Boraiyw maninang alasi fwrkhou\" -2\n\n-A-\n\nDhwrwmiya jiu khangnw, jwngkhou fwrwngdw\nSwithw lama thabainw, tulunga hwdw-2\nThwiso thangso oraibw\nSwithwni lama thabaigwn -2\n\n-B-\n\nRongja rongja de rongja, dinwini sanao\nRongjabaogwn mabwla, dinwi nongabla-2\nPhorbunao jwng rongjayw bla\nSwrgwao arpho rongjayw -2"
}